          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When a Psychic test is taken for this model, you can re-roll the result. When a Psychic test or a Deny the Witch test is taken for this model, add 1 to the total.</characteristic>
