                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When resolving an attack made by a model with this Relic, you can re-roll a hit roll of 1 and you can re-roll a wound roll of 1. When resolving an attack made by that model against an ADEPTUS ASTARTESunit or a HERETIC ASTARTESunit, add 1 to the hit roll and add 1 to the wound roll.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
