                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- At the start of the Fight phase, if the bearer is within Engagement Range of any enemy units, it can fight first that phase.
- The bearer is eligible to perform a Heroic Intervention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any enemy units, instead of 3&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically. Each time the bearer makes a Heroic Intervention move, it can move up to 6&quot;. All other rules for Heroic Interventions still apply.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
