                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- This Warlord is eligible to perform a Heroric intervention if it is within 6&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically of any enemy unit, instead of 3&quot; horizontally and 5&quot; vertically. Each time it makes a Heroic Intervention, it can move up to 6&quot; instead of 3&quot; (all other rules for Heroic Intervention still apply)
- The Warlord fights first in the  Fight Phase</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
